%% ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
%% Updated 2026-07-10.
%% Purpose: Reviewee confirms or disputes received review
%% Excludes: Skill review submission (see act_03a), scoring/anomaly (see act_03c), full dispute lifecycle (see act_03d)
%% Related: act_03a, act_03c, act_03d, seq_04c
%% ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
%% Reader intent: Show decision fork after review submission: accept, dispute, or add reverse feedback.
%% Key boundary: Diagram summarizes dispute quick path and reverse review branch, not full scoring internals.
%% Current caveat: Dispute creation here is only the entry fork; case-file build and AI evaluation belong to later escalation/admin handling, not an unconditional immediate side effect of confirm→dispute. Task-level reverse review submission is product-deprecated at current runtime.

flowchart TD
    Start(["From act_03a:
    Session completed"]) --> NotifyReviewee["Notify Reviewee
    to review results"]

    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
    %% REVIEWEE DECISION
    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
    NotifyReviewee --> RevieweeAction{"Reviewee action?"}

    RevieweeAction -->|"Confirm"| ConfirmReview["ConfirmReviewCommand
    → Review accepted
    → Scores flow into profile
    → Continue to act_03c"]

    RevieweeAction -->|"Dispute"| CreateDispute["ConfirmReviewCommand
    → append confirmations[]
    → review_sessions.status = 'disputed'
    → review_disputes row created
    → dispute status = 'pending'
    → See act_03d for full
    dispute lifecycle"]

    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
    %% DISPUTE QUICK PATH (summary)
    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
    CreateDispute --> DisputeRoom["Dispute room starts
    → comments/evidences exchange
    → may later escalate"]

    DisputeRoom --> AdminResolve["If escalated later:
    admin handling may build case file
    and optionally start AI evaluation
    before resolution"]

    AdminResolve["Admin resolves via
    ResolveReviewDisputeCommand
    → final_decision =
      uphold_review / adjust_score /
      request_re_review /
      dismiss_dispute /
      partially_accept"]

    AdminResolve --> DisputeDone["Dispute resolved
    → event-driven profile/reviewer
      recalculation only when
      resolution actions request it"]

    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
    %% REVERSE REVIEW
    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
    ConfirmReview --> ReverseCheck{"Reviewee wants
    reverse review?"}

    DisputeDone --> ReverseCheck

    ReverseCheck -->|No| GoScore(["→ Continue: act_03c"])
    ReverseCheck -->|Yes| WriteReverse["SubmitReverseReviewCommand
    → task-level reverse review submit
      is currently deprecated
    → command returns business error
    → reading surfaces may still exist"]
    WriteReverse --> GoScore

    %% ─── Styles ───
    classDef startEnd fill:#E8EAF6,stroke:#3F51B5,color:#333
    classDef review fill:#E3F2FD,stroke:#1565C0,color:#333
    classDef decision fill:#FFF3E0,stroke:#E65100,color:#333
    classDef dispute fill:#FFF9C4,stroke:#F57F17,color:#333
    class Start,GoScore startEnd
    class NotifyReviewee,ConfirmReview,WriteReverse review
    class RevieweeAction,ReverseCheck decision
    class CreateDispute,DisputeRoom,AdminResolve,DisputeDone dispute
